---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout noAds title="DMCA Policy" description="DMCA takedown policy for Resurgence Builds: how to report copyright concerns related to our Division Resurgence guides, builds, and community content." breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'DMCA Policy', url: '/dmca/' }]}>
  <div class="container section content-width">
    <h1 class="heading-accent">DMCA Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-muted);">Last updated: October 31, 2026</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Respect for Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>Resurgence Builds respects the intellectual property rights of others. If you believe that content on our site infringes your copyright, please follow the procedure below.</p>

      <h2>Visitor Comments</h2>
      <p>Articles, builds and guides have a comment section where visitors can post without an account. Everything else on the site is created and curated by the site operators. We review comments every day and remove spam and anything that breaks our <a href="/privacy/#comments">comment rules</a>. If a comment infringes your copyright, email <a href="mailto:p1@cfworx.tech">p1@cfworx.tech</a> with the subject line "Copyright Inquiry", the page address and the commenter's name, and we'll take it down.</p>

      <h2>Reporting Copyright Claims</h2>
      <p>If you believe that any article or image on our site infringes on your copyright, please contact us at <a href="mailto:p1@cfworx.tech">p1@cfworx.tech</a> with the subject line "Copyright Inquiry".</p>

      <h2>Repeat Infringers</h2>
      <p>We remove comments from anyone who repeatedly posts infringing material and block them from commenting.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
